OL,3,AOscar-winning producer says BBC gave
OL,4,Aher #400,000 payout after she raised
OL,5,Aantisemitism concerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Oscar-winning executive producer
OL,8,Fclaims she received a #400,000 payout
OL,9,Ffrom the BBC after alleging she faced
OL,10,Fantisemitic remarks from colleagues at
OL,11,Fthe corporation.
OL,13,FLucie Kon, who worked as a
OL,14,Fcommissioning editor overseeing several
OL,15,Fdocumentaries, including Mr Nobody
OL,16,FAgainst Putin, told The Telegraph that
OL,17,FBBC colleagues said Zionists like her
OL,18,Fwere "evil" following the 7 October
OL,19,Fattacks.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
