OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AOscar-winning producer says BBC gave
OL,4,Aher #400,000 payout after she raised
OL,5,Aantisemitism concerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FKon's post was made redundant as part
OL,8,Fof a BBC restructure. She said the
OL,9,Fpayment she received was for redundancy
OL,10,Fback pay and settlement for personal
OL,11,Finjury caused by the process.
OL,13,FThe BBC says it did not uphold any of
OL,14,Fthe allegations of antisemitism but
OL,15,Faccepted there were "shortcomings" in
OL,16,Fhow it treated Kon, which had a
OL,17,F"personal impact" on her.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
